### commerce health
GET http://localhost:8088/actuator/health
X-Request-Id: manual-commerce-health

### commerce liveness
GET http://localhost:8088/actuator/health/liveness

### commerce prometheus
GET http://localhost:8088/actuator/prometheus

### P17 the marketplace feed (public; a user token personalises card-match)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/deals?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P17 one deal with its savings at a spend (₹75,000)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/deals/{{dealId}}?spendPaise=7500000

### P17 the signed redirect (clickPath from the feed): 302 to the merchant with subid=<click id>
GET http://localhost:8080{{clickPath}}

### P17 apply for a card (Idempotency-Key required)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/card-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardProductId": "{{cardProductId}}"}

### P17 my applications
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/card-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P17 an ad for a slot (home | deal-detail | dashboard)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/ads/serve?placement=home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P17 affiliate postback (Postback-Signature: t=<unix>,v1=<hex HMAC-SHA256 of "<t>." + body>)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/webhooks/affiliate/mock
Postback-Signature: {{postbackSignature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ref": "ord-1", "subid": "{{clickId}}", "status": "approved", "amountPaise": 250000, "commissionPaise": 10000, "occurredAt": "2026-11-08T10:00:00Z"}

### P17 admin: create a deal (commerce:write)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/commerce/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId": "0192f1e2-0000-7000-8000-00000000e001", "merchantName": "Mock Mart", "title": "10% off, capped",
 "categoryPath": "shopping.online", "components": [{"kind": "percent", "valueBps": 1000, "capPaise": 500000},
 {"kind": "percent", "valueBps": 500, "capPaise": 200000}], "eligibleCardProducts": [], "referenceSpendPaise": 7500000,
 "network": "mock", "landingUrl": "https://merchant.example/p", "commissionBps": 400}

### P17 admin: the open application queue, then a decision (If-Match = the application's version)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/commerce/card-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/commerce/card-applications/{{applicationId}}:decide
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
If-Match: "1"
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "approved", "reason": "Meets the issuer's criteria"}

### P17 admin: stats over IST days
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/admin/commerce/stats?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-08
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
